---@alias gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.StringMap { [string]: string }

---@class gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.UndeleteProjectsSitesCustomDomainsRequest
---@field validateOnly? boolean If true, Hosting validates that it's possible to complete your request but doesn't actually delete the `CustomDomain`.
---@field etag? string A tag that represents the state of the `CustomDomain` as you know it. If present, the supplied tag must match the current value on your `CustomDomain`, or the request fails.
---@field name string Required. The name of the `CustomDomain` to delete.

---@class gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.UpdateConfigProjectsSitesRequest
---@field maxVersions? string The number of FINALIZED versions that will be held for a site before automatic deletion. When a new version is deployed, content for versions in storage in excess of this number will be deleted, and will no longer be billed for storage usage. Oldest versions will be deleted first; sites are created with an unlimited number of max_versions by default.
---@field cloudLoggingEnabled? boolean Whether or not web requests made by site visitors are logged via Cloud Logging.
---@field updateMask? string A set of field names from your [site configuration](../sites.SiteConfig) that you want to update. A field will be overwritten if, and only if, it's in the mask. If a mask is not provided then a default mask of only [`max_versions`](../sites.SiteConfig.max_versions) will be used.
---@field name string Required. The site for which to update the SiteConfig, in the format: sites/ site-name/config

---@class gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.UpdateConfigSitesRequest
---@field maxVersions? string The number of FINALIZED versions that will be held for a site before automatic deletion. When a new version is deployed, content for versions in storage in excess of this number will be deleted, and will no longer be billed for storage usage. Oldest versions will be deleted first; sites are created with an unlimited number of max_versions by default.
---@field cloudLoggingEnabled? boolean Whether or not web requests made by site visitors are logged via Cloud Logging.
---@field updateMask? string A set of field names from your [site configuration](../sites.SiteConfig) that you want to update. A field will be overwritten if, and only if, it's in the mask. If a mask is not provided then a default mask of only [`max_versions`](../sites.SiteConfig.max_versions) will be used.
---@field name string Required. The site for which to update the SiteConfig, in the format: sites/ site-name/config

