---A `Version` is a configuration and a collection of static files which determine how a site is displayed.
---@class gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.Version
---@field deleteTime? string Output only. The time at which the version was `DELETED`.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.VersionStatusEnum|string The deploy status of the version. For a successful deploy, call [`CreateVersion`](sites.versions/create) to make a new version (`CREATED` status), [upload all desired files](sites.versions/populateFiles) to the version, then [update](sites.versions/patch) the version to the `FINALIZED` status. Note that if you leave the version in the `CREATED` state for more than 12 hours, the system will automatically mark the version as `ABANDONED`. You can also change the status of a version to `DELETED` by calling [`DeleteVersion`](sites.versions/delete).
---@field config? gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.ServingConfig The configuration for the behavior of the site. This configuration exists in the [`firebase.json`](https://firebase.google.com/docs/cli/#the_firebasejson_file) file.
---@field createTime? string Output only. The time at which the version was created.
---@field createUser? gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.ActingUser Output only. Identifies the user who created the version.
---@field finalizeTime? string Output only. The time at which the version was `FINALIZED`.
---@field versionBytes? string Output only. The total stored bytesize of the version. This value is calculated after a version is `FINALIZED`.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.StringMap The labels used for extra metadata and/or filtering.
---@field deleteUser? gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.ActingUser Output only. Identifies the user who `DELETED` the version.
---@field fileCount? string Output only. The total number of files associated with the version. This value is calculated after a version is `FINALIZED`.
---@field name? string The fully-qualified resource name for the version, in the format: sites/ SITE_ID/versions/VERSION_ID This name is provided in the response body when you call [`CreateVersion`](sites.versions/create).
---@field finalizeUser? gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.ActingUser Output only. Identifies the user who `FINALIZED` the version.

---A static content file that is part of a version.
---@class gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.VersionFile
---@field path? string The URI at which the file's content should display.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.VersionFileStatusEnum Output only. The current status of a particular file in the specified version. The value will be either `pending upload` or `uploaded`.
---@field hash? string The SHA256 content hash of the file.

---@alias gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.VersionFileList gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.VersionFile[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.VersionFileStatusEnum "STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"|"EXPECTED"|"ACTIVE"

