---@alias gcp.unstable.firebasehosting_v1beta1.VersionStatusEnum "VERSION_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"|"CREATED"|"FINALIZED"|"DELETED"|"ABANDONED"|"EXPIRED"|"CLONING"

